[1748.527005, "o", "                           \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m 10 +\u001b[38;5;236m**Conclusion:** Dual HER2 blockade was associated with a higher pCR rate, consistent with randomized \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mtrials, but the estimate depended on adjustment for treatment era. The data were insufficient to asse\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m  \u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;236mss event-free or overall surviv\u001b[43Gl.\u001b[46G   \u001b[50G          \u001b[61G    \u001b[66G \u001b[68G      \u001b[75G   \u001b[79G     \u001b[85G          \u001b[96G    \u001b[101G          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m⏺\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(\u001b]8;id=1jie7yw;file:///Users/Shared/her2-neoadjuvant-study/manuscript/text/introduction.md\u0007manuscript/text/introduction.md\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;174m✢\u001b[5Gewi\u001b[17G\u001b[38;5;241m3\u001b[25G9\u001b[27G0\u001b[39m\u001b[28;1H\u001b[26;3H\u001b[?25h"]
