[1971.193238, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236mrandomized trials. We also report that the unweighted pCR rates were almost identical\u001b[48;5;157m,\u001b[48;5;194m \u001b[48;5;157mat \u001b[48;5;194m{{pcr_crude\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m_dual}} and {{pcr_crude_single}}\u001b[48;5;157m,\u001b[48;5;194m and explain why, and we show that the data were insufficient to ass\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mess event-free or overall survival. We believe that this transparent handling of treatment-era confou\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mnding in a regional real-world cohort will interest the readers of the Journal, many of whom face the\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m same question when interpreting their own institutional data.                                       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 12 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;236m\u001b[2m 13 \u001b[22m We confirm that this manuscript has not been published, is not under consideration for publication el\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m sewhere, and has not been presented at a scientific meeting, and that"]
