[2098.797125, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;236m\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m als that included the null value. Propensity-score matching retained {{n_s2_pairs}} pairs and yielded\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m  a smaller estimate (OR, {{pcr_or_s2|b}}). The association did not differ by hormone receptor status \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m (receptor-negative OR, {{or_hr_negative|b}}; receptor-positive OR, {{or_hr_positive|b}}; {{p_interact\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m ion_hr}} for interaction). The E-value for the primary OR was {{evalue_pcr}}, and that for its lower \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[22m confidence limit was {{evalue_pcr_ci}}.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m 20 +\u001b[38;5;236m                                                                                                     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m 21 +\u001b[38;5;236m## Post Hoc Analyses                                                                                 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m 22 +\u001b[38;5;236m                                                                                                     \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;29m"]
