[2098.798177, "o", "C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mts), {{tdm1_2012_2019}} of those without pCR received adjuvant T-DM1, and the HR for EFS was {{efs_hr\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m_2012_2019}}. With follow-up truncated at five years, the HRs were {{efs_hr_5y}} for EFS and {{os_hr_\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m5y}} for OS. Pertuzumab was started on the index date in {{pz_from_index}} patients and later in {{pz\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m_later}} (median, day {{pz_later_median_day}}), whereas the earliest surgery or disease progression i\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mn the single-blockade group occurred on day {{single_min_day}}, so no patient could have been classif\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mied as receiving single blockade because of an event before pertuzumab would have been added.        \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;5;174m✢\u001b[26G\u001b[38;5;241m7\u001b[28G8\u001b[39m\u001b[28;1H\u001b[26;3H\u001b[?25h"]
