[2100.243818, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[7G\u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m  \u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;236moperated\u001b[20Gon\u001b[23Gat\u001b[26Ganother\u001b[34Ghospital\u001b[43Gwere\u001b[48Gincluded,\u001b[58Gthe\u001b[62GOR\u001b[65Gwas\u001b[69G{{or_elsewhere_no_pcr}}\u001b[93Gunder\u001b[99Gthe\u001b[103Gassumptio\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m  \u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;236mn that none\u001b[23Gof them achieved\u001b[40GpCR\u001b[44Gand\u001b[48G{{or_elsewhere_all_pcr}}\u001b[73Gunder\u001b[79Gthe\u001b[83Gassumption\u001b[94Gthat\u001b[99Gall\u001b[103Gdid.\u001b[108GAmon\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m  \u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;236mg\u001b[13Gpatients\u001b[22Gwho\u001b[26Gstarted\u001b[34Gtreatment\u001b[44Gin\u001b[47G2012–2019\u001b[57G({{n_2012_2019_dual}}\u001b[79Gand\u001b[83G{{n_2012_2019_single}}\u001b[106Gpatien\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m  \u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;236mts), {{tdm1_2012_2019}} of those without pCR received\u001b[65Gadjuvant T-DM1, and th\u001b[88G HR for\u001b[96GEFS\u001b[100Gwas {{efs_hr\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B_2012_2019}}. With follo\u001b[36G-up\u001b[40Gtruncated\u001b[50Gat five years, the HR\u001b[72G were {{efs_hr_5y}} \u001b[93Gor EFS and {{os_hr_\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B5y}} for\u001b[20GOS. P\u001b[26Grtuzumab was started on the index date in {{\u001b[71Gz_from_index}} patients and lat\u001b[103Gr in\u001b[108G{{pz\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B_later}} (median, day {{"]
[2100.243944, "o", "pz_l\u001b[40Gter_median_day}}), whereas the earliest surgery or \u001b[92Gise\u001b[96Gse progression i\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bn the single-blockad\u001b[32G gr\u001b[36Gu\u001b[38G occurred\u001b[48Go\u001b[50G day {{single_min_day}}, so no patient could have b\u001b[102Gen class\u001b[111Gf\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bied \u001b[16Gs\u001b[18Grec\u001b[22Giving single blockade\u001b[44Gbecause of an event before pertuzumab would have been added.   \u001b[108G    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m⏺\u001b[3G\u001b[39m正文改好了。接著在補充資料加上 \u001b[1mTable S4\u001b[22m（事後分析結果總表）和 \u001b[1mFigure S2\u001b[22m（兩組傾向分數分布圖），並把 Figure S2\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B加進要上傳的圖檔清單。\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m⏺\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAdding Table S4 and Figure S2, rebuilding draft and checking\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m  ⎿  $ python3 - <<'EOF'\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241mimport pathlib\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241mt = pathlib.Path(\"manuscript/R/tables.R\"); s = t.read_text()\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;241ma = \"supplementary_tables <- function(max_rows) c(supp_baseline_parts(max_rows), list(supp_subgro"]
