[2113.723674, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236m for event-free survival and {{os_hr}} for overall survival.                                         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m  9 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;236m\u001b[2m 10 \u001b[22m **Conclusion:** Dual HER2 blockade was associated with a higher pCR rate, consistent with randomized \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m trials, but the estimate depended on adjustment for treatment era and on assumptions about patients w\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m ithout pathology results. The data were insufficient to assess event-free or overall survival.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m  ⎿  (timeout 10m)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m⏺\u001b[3G\u001b[39m摘要已改成 242 字，檢查全數通過。我同時發現並修正了原稿中將 E-value\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B誤寫成勝算比（應為風險比）的用詞錯誤，並補上方法段漏寫的「追蹤時間中位數採反向 Kaplan-Meier\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B法估計」說明（恰好回應了審稿人 R2.2 的提問）。接下來撰寫回覆信，僅記錄回應內容與修"]
[2113.723798, "o", "改位置，不重複抄錄審稿原文。\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mFixing E-value wording, adding reverse KM, writing response source\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m  ⎿  $ python3 - <<'EOF'\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241mimport pathlib\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;5;241mdef \u001b[11Gdi\u001b[14G(path, pairs):\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bp = pathlib.Path(path); s = p.read_text()\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;241mfor a, b in pairs:\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;5;241massert s.count(a) == 1, (path, a[:60]); s = s.replace(a, b)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;5;241mp.write_text(s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241medit(\"manuscript/text/discussion.md\", [\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;241m(\"an unmeasured confounder associated with both treatment and pC…\r\u001b[17C\u001b[2B9\u001b[39m\u001b[28;1H\u001b[26;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[2113.725853, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[11B\u001b[38;5;241m⏺\u001b[39m\u001b[28;1H\u001b[26;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[2113.754696, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;236m\u001b[48;5;194mwith Schoenf\u001b[25Gld res\u001b[32Gduals\u001b[48;5;157m, and median follow-up was estimated with the reverse Kaplan-Meier method\u001b[48;5;194m.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mPrespecified sensitivity analyses restricted the cohort to patients who started treatment in 2016–201\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m9, used one-to-one propensity-score matching, used multivariable regression, defined pCR as ypT0 ypN0\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m, and included only patients with complete covariate data. An exploratory analysis tested whether the\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m association with pCR differed by hormone receptor status. The E-value was calculated to quantify how\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236m strong unmeasured confounding would need to be to explain away the primary result.[@vanderweele2017e\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236mvalue] Two-sided *P* values below 0.05 were considered statistically significant. Analyses were perfo\r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3"]
