[2121.588357, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;5;29m\u001b[48;5;194m    +\u001b[38;5;236mevents_dual}} and {{os_events_single}} patients, and the weighted five-year OS rates were {{os_5y_dua\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236ml}} and {{os_5y_single}} (HR, {{os_hr|b}}) (Figure 3). The five-year RMST difference was {{rmst5_efs}\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m    +\u001b[38;5;236m} for EFS and {{rmst5_os}} for OS. The confidence interval for OS was wide and compatible with both a\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;29m  \u001b[11G\u001b[38;5;236m clinically impo\u001b[28Gtant ben\u001b[38Git and harm. There was no evid\u001b[69Gnce against\u001b[81Gpr\u001b[84Gportional\u001b[94Ghazards for EFS ({\r\u001b[10C\u001b[1B{efs_ph_p}}) or\u001b[27GOS ({{os_ph_p}}). Among p\u001b[53Gtients who d\u001b[66Gd not\u001b[72Gachiev\u001b[79G pCR, adjuvant T-DM1 was given to\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B{{tdm1_non_pcr_dual\u001b[33G in th\u001b[40G dual-blockade group and {{tdm1_non_pcr_single}} in the singl\u001b[102G-blockade \r\u001b[10C\u001b[1Bgroup.       \u001b[25G   \u001b[29G                    \u001b[50G         \u001b[60G   \u001b[64G   \u001b[68G        \u001b[77G         \u001b[87G  \u001b[90G     \u001b[96G    \u001b[101G           \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 16 \u001b[22m \u001b[3"]
[2121.588486, "o", "9m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;236m\u001b[2m 17 \u001b[22m ## Sensitivity and Subgroup Analyses\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;236m\u001b[2m 18 \u001b[22m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;16m⏺\u001b[3G\u001b[39m比對程式測出兩個瑕疵：引用標記黏在前一個字上造成誤判，以及兩版引用編號不一致導致同篇文獻被誤認為不同引用。我會讓引用\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B標記獨立成詞並改用文獻名稱當代號來修正。\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mMaking citations standalone, content-keyed diff\u001b[51Gtokens\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;241m  ⎿  $ python3 - <<'EOF'\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bimport pathlib\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;241mp = pathlib.Path(\"manuscript/style/mark_changes.py\"); s = p.read_text()\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;5;241mstart = s.index(\"def protect(text):\"); end = s.index(\"def ins(words):\")\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bs = s[:start] + '''def protect(text):\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;5;241m\"\"\"Turn each citation group into its own token named by its content, so the same c…\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;5;216mFrosting…\u001b[39m\u001b[28;1H\u001b[26;3H\u001b[?25h"]
